 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Falso amigo: mundane",
     "texto": [
      "**Mundane** describe algo muy ordinario y normalmente poco interesante: una tarea puede ser rutinaria, aunque importante. No equivale aquí a «mundano» en el sentido de «relativo al mundo y no a lo espiritual»; para ese sentido se usa **worldly**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Patrimonio",
     "texto": [
      "**Heritage** = patrimonio. **Preserve** = conservar. **Restoration** = restauración. **Ruins** = ruinas. **Sculpture** = escultura. **Inscription** = inscripción, texto grabado en piedra. **Town hall** es el edificio; **council**, el órgano municipal."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "etapa": "leer",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Informe de conservación",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The old town hall, which was built in the sixteenth century, is part of the city's heritage.",
       "alumno": "El antiguo ayuntamiento, que se construyó en el siglo XVI, forma parte del patrimonio de la ciudad.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "town hall",
         "ayuntamiento"
        ],
        [
         "heritage",
         "patrimonio"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Because cracks were found in the stonework, the building was closed to visitors.",
       "alumno": "Debido a que encontraron grietas en la mampostería, se cerró el edificio al público.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "cracks",
         "grietas"
        ],
        [
         "stonework",
         "mampostería"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The archive had been moved before restoration began, so the documents were protected.",
       "alumno": "El archivo se había trasladado antes de que empezara la restauración, así que los documentos quedaron protegidos.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "archive",
         "archivo"
        ],
        [
         "restoration",
         "restauración"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "A sculpture near the entrance was damaged, but its inscription could still be read.",
       "alumno": "Una escultura cerca de la entrada resultó dañada, pero aún se podía leer su inscripción.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "sculpture",
         "escultura"
        ],
        [
         "inscription",
         "inscripción"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Experts have now repaired the roof, and the main hall has been preserved.",
       "alumno": "Los expertos ya han reparado el tejado y se ha conservado el salón principal.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "experts",
         "expertos"
        ],
        [
         "preserved",
         "conservado"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The guidebook explains which features are original and which were added later.",
       "alumno": "La guía explica qué elementos son originales y cuáles se añadieron más tarde.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "guidebook",
         "guía"
        ],
        [
         "features",
         "elementos"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The report describes routine cleaning as mundane but important for preserving the stonework.",
       "alumno": "El informe describe la limpieza rutinaria como una tarea cotidiana y poco interesante, pero importante para conservar la mampostería.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "mundane",
         "banal, rutinario"
        ],
        [
         "preserving",
         "conservar"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The council says the work should have been completed sooner, but it was important to protect the historic details.",
       "alumno": "El ayuntamiento dice que las obras deberían haberse terminado antes, pero era importante proteger los detalles históricos.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "should have been completed",
         "deberían haberse terminado"
        ],
        [
         "details",
         "detalles"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The restoration is not finished: the archive is still closed, and another inspection is planned.",
       "alumno": "La restauración no ha terminado: el archivo sigue cerrado y se ha previsto otra inspección.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "inspection",
         "inspección"
        ],
        [
         "still",
